<div class="card"><h1>Upload 1–4 timeframes</h1><p class="muted">Upload the SAME pair at different timeframes. The engine treats them as one market: higher timeframe context → setup → current price → lower-timeframe confirmation.</p>
<form id="form"><label>SYMBOL</label><select name="symbol" style="width:100%;background:#050d15;color:white;padding:11px;border:1px solid #29435b;border-radius:8px"><option>XAUUSD</option><option>EURUSD</option><option>GBPUSD</option><option>USDJPY</option><option>BTCUSD</option><option>V75</option><option>OTHER</option></select><div class="uploadGrid" id="slots"></div><button class="btn" id="go">ANALYZE ALL TIMEFRAMES</button><div id="err" class="error"></div></form></div>
